flowchart LR
    U[Evaluator / Decision Maker]
    UI[Streamlit Research Dashboard]
    API[FastAPI Backend]
    O[Pipeline Orchestrator]
    C[Classifier Agent]
    S[Tavily Search]
    E[Extraction Agent]
    V[Evidence Agent]
    Y[Synthesis Agent]
    DB[(SQLite Knowledge Base)]
    CH[(Chroma Semantic Index)]
    LLM[Groq Llama 3.3 70B]
    SRC[Source Web Pages]

    U --> UI
    UI -->|POST /research| API
    UI -->|poll research id| API
    UI -->|search findings| API
    API --> O
    O --> C
    C --> LLM
    C -->|domain + sub-questions| O
    O --> S
    S --> SRC
    SRC -->|source pages + metadata| O
    O --> E
    E --> LLM
    O --> V
    V --> LLM
    O --> Y
    Y --> LLM
    O -->|topics, sources, findings, events, contradictions, conclusions, pipeline events| DB
    O -->|finding embeddings| CH
    API --> DB
    API --> CH
    DB --> UI
    CH --> UI
